WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
QUESTIONS THAT HELP BUILD TRUST

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
"Sometimes these complaints, symptoms or behaviours
can be linked to stress, tension or violence..."

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
"I've seen children with symptoms like yours
who were experiencing violence."

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
"I feel that something has happened
that's troubling you. Would you like to talk about it?"

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
OPEN-ENDED QUESTIONS

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:39.000
"What is making you sad?"

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.000
"Why don't you want to go to training anymore?"

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.500
"How did you get these injuries?"
